- UI language: **Russian**
- Follow phased plan in `docs/phases/` — current phase README is source of truth
- Architecture docs: `docs/architecture/`
- Game rules: `docs/game-rules/podkidnoy-durak.md`
- Do not skip phases; Phase 3 game UI is critical before bot logic
- Unit tests per phase: `docs/architecture/testing.md`; run `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest` before next phase
